# Local config UI (dev only). Set both to open the app outside the Saleor
# Dashboard iframe. VITE_SALEOR_APP_TOKEN is a short-lived staff JWT with
# MANAGE_APPS — copy it from a real Dashboard session's Authorization header.
# A long-lived API token authenticates GraphQL fine but is not a JWT, so it
# will not verify here. Give VITE_SALEOR_API_URL the full GraphQL endpoint,
# e.g. https://store.saleor.cloud/graphql/ — the same shape a real Dashboard
# session sends.
VITE_SALEOR_API_URL=
VITE_SALEOR_APP_TOKEN=
